<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dashboard - FTI Logistik</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        :root { --background: 0 0% 100%; --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%; --primary: 221.2 83.2% 53.3%; --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%; --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%; --radius: 0.5rem; }
        .card { border-radius: var(--radius); border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); background-color: hsl(var(--background)); padding: 1.5rem; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .sidebar { width: 260px; border-right: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); height: 100vh; position: fixed; }
        .main-content { margin-left: 260px; padding: 2rem; background-color: #fafafa; min-height: 100vh; }
        .nav-item { display: block; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; border-radius: var(--radius); color: #444; transition: all 0.2s; }
        .nav-item:hover { background-color: #f1f5f9; color: hsl(var(--primary)); }
        .nav-item.active { background-color: #f1f5f9; color: hsl(var(--primary)); font-weight: 600; }
        .btn-outline { border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: var(--radius); font-size: 0.875rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="sidebar bg-white p-4">
        <div class="mb-8 px-2">
            <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-600">FTI Logistik</h1>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Sistem Manajemen</p>
        </div>
        
        <nav class="space-y-1">
            <a href="/dashboard" class="nav-item active">Dashboard</a>
            <a href="#" class="nav-item">Kelola Data Item</a>
            <a href="#" class="nav-item">Kelola Kategori</a>
            <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
                <a href="/logout" class="nav-item text-red-600 hover:bg-red-50">Logout</a>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </div>

    <main class="main-content">
        <header class="flex justify-between items-center mb-8">
            <div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Dashboard Utama</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-500">Selamat datang kembali, <%= role %>!</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                <span class="text-sm font-medium bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Admin Mode</span>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8">
            <div class="card bg-white">
                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">Total Item</p>
                <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-1">124</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="card bg-white">
                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">Kategori</p>
                <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-1">12</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="card bg-white">
                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">Aktivitas Terakhir</p>
                <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-1">Baru Saja</h3>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card bg-white">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-4">Status Modul B9</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
                Tahap 1 (Otentikasi & ACL) telah berhasil diimplementasikan. Minggu depan kita bakal lanjut buat fitur CRUD di sini bro!
            </p>
        </div>
    </main>

</body>
</html>